 "summary": "Too relaxed tar detection in ArchiveStreamFactory"
 "description": "The relaxed tar detection logic added in [](https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/COMPRESS-117 \"Certain tar files not recognised by ArchiveStreamFactory\") unfortunately matches also some non-tar files like a [test AIFF file](https://svn.apache.org/repos/asf/tika/trunk/tika-parsers/src/test/resources/test-documents/testAIFF.aif) that Apache Tika uses. It would be good to improve the detection heuristics to still match files like the one in [](https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/COMPRESS-117 \"Certain tar files not recognised by ArchiveStreamFactory\") but avoid false positives like the AIFF file in Tika."
}

